# Make one default player and vehicle playable in the complete world

Create the first real vertical slice only after the world exists. One default
player and one default vehicle must exercise the runtime contracts without
requiring the final character or vehicle asset set.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Walk, run, turn, jump, interact, enter and exit a vehicle, and recover
  using source-backed gameplay semantics.
- [ ] Drive, steer, accelerate, brake, reverse, collide, recover, and use the
  representative vehicle camera in the authored world.
- [ ] Support keyboard/mouse and controller input needed by the vertical slice.
- [ ] Validate world collision, streaming, camera transitions, and
  player/vehicle
  ownership through the same representative flow.

## Dependencies

Depends on the complete source-faithful world milestone.
